  "description": "Bring a soft and playful rainbow aesthetic to your creative projects with this pastel rainbow diagonal stripes seamless pattern. Featuring gentle pastel hues arranged in a dynamic angled stripe layout, this versatile repeating design is perfect for digital backgrounds, scrapbook papers, invitations, stationery, fabric projects, packaging, apparel, nursery artwork, birthday decorations, and cheerful seasonal crafts. The seamless format allows you to create continuous designs at any scale while maintaining a polished and cohesive appearance.\n✨What’s Included:\n•15 seamless patterns\n•Format: JPEG\n•Size: 3600 × 3600 px\n•High-resolution digital files\n✨Perfect for:\n•Digital scrapbooking\n•Journaling and planners\n•Birthday invitations\n•Baby and kids’ designs\n•Nursery decor\n•Party stationery\n•Greeting cards\n•Fabric and textile projects\n•Wrapping paper and packaging\n•Social media graphics\n•Printable crafts\n•DIY creative projects",
